category: Libs
build-depends: cygport 
sdesc: "Powerful but simple template language for C++ (utilities)"
ldesc: "CTemplate is a simple but powerful template language for C++. It emphasizes
separating logic from presentation: it is impossible to embed application
logic in this template language."
